New in v6 (2026-11-24)
----------------------
Conservation Mode (v6)
  Preferences has a Conservation Mode section. If your laptop's driver
  supports it, it shows whether it is ON or OFF and has Turn on / Turn off
  buttons, which take effect immediately (no need to press OK). The setting
  is kept by the laptop itself, not in vattery's config file.
